  "name": "First Aid",
  "slug": "first-aid",
  "teaser": "Fillable medkits and full body healing items",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/q2SegUzf5fNVOUzYjs2ePueOhGEAVYsnaVHfPEkL.png",
  "downloads": 414,
  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<h1>DEPENDENCIES</h1>\n<pre><code>-&gt; WTT CommonLib 1.0.0\n</code></pre>\n<h1>DISCLAIMER</h1>\n<p>This is a fork of <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1753/custom-first-aid-kits\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">kyoukopan’s Custom First Aid Kits</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Creates separate medkits that act as containers.</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>NEW FEATURES</h1>\n<h5>Medkits</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>The fillable medkits now have custom grid layouts to represent the physical shape of the container.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Medical Items</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Adds new medical items that administer transfusions or injections to replace traditional medkits with full body healing.</li>\n<li>Reworks existing medical items to offer different functionality or balance.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Most notably:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Augmentin now buffs Surgery skill at the cost of Metabolism.</li>\n<li>Goldenstar now “wakes you up” with a large list of attention-focused buffs.</li>\n<li>Analgesic painkillers now have a small chance to cause side effects.</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>HIGHLY RECOMMENDED MODS</h1>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1657/mergeconsumables#versions\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Merge Consumables 1.3.1</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2466/rarities\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Rarities</a></p>\n<h1>CONFLICTING MODS</h1>\n<p>As this is a near-total overhaul of all medical items, it is not recommended to use other mods that also affect the medical items, i.e. Realism’s medical changes.</p>\n<p>//////////////////</p>\n<p>Fillable first aid kits with custom layouts\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442676336249274418/firstaid1.png?ex=69264c8a&amp;is=6924fb0a&amp;hm=e8709fd7d55510c9364b591f4a48a89b16443720716fc29fcab5d13760afc44a&amp;\" alt=\"fa1\" /></p>\n<p>Saline injector item (full body healing)\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/336226931085279233/1442676336924561560/firstaid2.png?ex=69264c8a&amp;is=6924fb0a&amp;hm=ca7def979fee2fb2ef01b09b1e222f9535e19a9080469db98a1a819971c2c8ef&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless\" alt=\"fa2\" /></p>\n<p>Saline bag item (full body healing)\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442676337738383430/firstaid3.png?ex=69264c8a&amp;is=6924fb0a&amp;hm=0cd08e2391c4d8ecafcf92cbea522c0afae400ddb65fff404f24cc7630f845a7&amp;\" alt=\"fa3\" /></p>\n<p>Blood bag item (now O-, full body healing) Original model credit: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/blood-bag-c5d5f9b7a9a84440bb16ca5ce660901c\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">FLO_wav</a>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442676338501882098/firstaid4.png?ex=69264c8a&amp;is=6924fb0a&amp;hm=dc8ee79949db45c7d1d20ba3a9be50b7f5905a6553dfbecf8fa6b61ccac285de&amp;\" alt=\"fa4\" /></p>\n<p>Sorry, I don’t know how to make tabs :)</p>\n",
